    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome To Simple Clicker !</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Description</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You click to obtain resources and sell the raw material for a quick buck. You'll start off with the<u> Wood Clicker</u>\u00a0but as you earn coins, you'll be given the opportunity to unlock other clickers which give you the ability to obtain a new resource</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrades</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >each resource clicker has its own upgrade panel.\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yield upgrade - increase the number of units you receive from the respective clickers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Production upgrade - increase the rate at which the raw materials are yielded</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quality Upgrade - Increase the value of the produced material at the cost of production time.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome To Simple Clicker !</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Description</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You click to obtain resources and sell the raw material for a quick buck. You'll start off with the<u> Wood Clicker</u>\u00a0but as you earn coins, you'll be given the opportunity to unlock other clickers which give you the ability to obtain a new resource</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrades</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >each resource clicker has its own upgrade panel.\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yield upgrade - increase the number of units you receive from the respective clickers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Production upgrade - increase the rate at which the raw materials are yielded</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quality Upgrade - Increase the value of the produced material at the cost of production time.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Simple Clicker is a satisfying idle clicker where every tap earns you valuable resources! Gather materials, sell them for coins, and upgrade your production to maximize profits",
